I am in the kitchen.
I drink my morning coffee.
My phone is on the table.
I pick up the phone.
I open the weather app.
There is very bright sunlight outside.
It will be very hot during the day today.
The temperature is very high.
Then I check the evening weather.
There is a strange thing in the app.
It will rain this evening!
I am surprised.
Right now it is the hot season in Mumbai.
Will it really rain?
I look at the phone again.
Yes, there is a picture of rain in it.
The weather will be nice in the evening.
I happily finish my coffee.
